<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sets one-week repo tender at 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sets one-week repo tender at 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Friday set a one-week repo tender at 12.9 percent, up from the previous rate of 12.4 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB said it would accept a maximum of two bids each at a minimum of 100 million crowns.</p>
